(1572997, 210783, 24976, '<td valign="top">very good use of light and shadows. two things i might have changed would have been removing the clock since its so near to the edge that it is more of a distraction rather than narrative element, and imo the tungsten torchiere lamp since it is a different color of light could have been off. But then again  the photo is about how the room was at that moment in time.</td>', 'very good use of light and shadows. two things i might have changed would have been removing the clock since its so near to the edge that it is more of a distraction rather than narrative element, and imo the tungsten torchiere lamp since it is a different color of light could have been off. But then again  the photo is about how the room was at that moment in time.', '2005-07-30 01:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
