(1573985, 210668, 31403, '<td valign="top">the odd tilt and addition of all that white space puzzles me.  if the white were black it would be better, the white just overpowers the content of your photo.  I really like the idea of the photo before the rotate, I would like to see that</td>', 'the odd tilt and addition of all that white space puzzles me.  if the white were black it would be better, the white just overpowers the content of your photo.  I really like the idea of the photo before the rotate, I would like to see that', '2005-07-30 11:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1573986, 210674, 24454, '<td valign="top">My MOST favorite in this challenge.   I absolutely LOVE it!    I seriously hope to see it in the top 3!!!  10</td>', 'My MOST favorite in this challenge.   I absolutely LOVE it!    I seriously hope to see it in the top 3!!!  10', '2005-07-30 11:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
