(1573995, 210564, 25742, '<td valign="top">there is something that brings me back to this photo, prolly the strong light coming in the window. the room looks very inviting, but makes you wonder why there is nobody there. I don''t know if it would be better with ppl in the frame, but that would add more to the photo and steal the attention away from the eternal sunshine out there. I think I''d like to see a person against the window, in silhouette. Anyhow, I like this one. Best of luck to you. /8</td>', 'there is something that brings me back to this photo, prolly the strong light coming in the window. the room looks very inviting, but makes you wonder why there is nobody there. I don''t know if it would be better with ppl in the frame, but that would add more to the photo and steal the attention away from the eternal sunshine out there. I think I''d like to see a person against the window, in silhouette. Anyhow, I like this one. Best of luck to you. /8', '2005-07-30 12:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1573998, 210928, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!!!    I had something just like this in mind for the circle challenge. . .but of course, I don''t have anything that beautiful in my surroundings to make it work.   This is great!</td>', 'Very nice!!!!    I had something just like this in mind for the circle challenge. . .but of course, I don''t have anything that beautiful in my surroundings to make it work.   This is great!', '2005-07-30 12:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
