(1574045, 210897, 31403, '<td valign="top">curse my cynicism!  I want to believe this is real, but I can think of ways to shoot it with props - I hope it is, I want it to be as great of a wildlife shot as I think it is - but if I think it is, that should be "real" enough.  Hmmm, we shall see, 7</td>', 'curse my cynicism!  I want to believe this is real, but I can think of ways to shoot it with props - I hope it is, I want it to be as great of a wildlife shot as I think it is - but if I think it is, that should be "real" enough.  Hmmm, we shall see, 7', '2005-07-30 12:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
