(1574408, 210819, 34247, '<td valign="top">The toning is nice, and the composition "inviting." The reading material is a bit low brow, but I really like the BASIC label on the shorts showing, as it gives a nice allusion to the basic activity being performed, as well as the basic processing that clearly had been done here. Must be nice to have a window in that room, as I''m sure it would provide enough illumination during the day. The socks clinch it.</td>', 'The toning is nice, and the composition "inviting." The reading material is a bit low brow, but I really like the BASIC label on the shorts showing, as it gives a nice allusion to the basic activity being performed, as well as the basic processing that clearly had been done here. Must be nice to have a window in that room, as I''m sure it would provide enough illumination during the day. The socks clinch it.', '2005-07-30 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574410, 210622, 34247, '<td valign="top">Beautiful noise and angry red tones. I like what appears to be a reflection of the seat cover on the water tank. Reminds me of beautifully jarring and edgy techno, and that trip to the loo during long, rythmically pulsing raves. Need champagne to take the edge off. Nice.</td>', 'Beautiful noise and angry red tones. I like what appears to be a reflection of the seat cover on the water tank. Reminds me of beautifully jarring and edgy techno, and that trip to the loo during long, rythmically pulsing raves. Need champagne to take the edge off. Nice.', '2005-07-30 15:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
