(1575084, 210695, 37544, '<td valign="top">I think that taking a picture of a mushroom was a good idea and I like your title, but the picture is waaaaayyy out of focus.</td>', 'I think that taking a picture of a mushroom was a good idea and I like your title, but the picture is waaaaayyy out of focus.', '2005-07-30 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575085, 210756, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like how the outside building mimics the lines of the inside room.  i wish the background was a bit darker.  with the strong contrast between the outside and the inside window panels you could have probably done some nice looking selective leveling on it if you so chose.</td>', 'i really like how the outside building mimics the lines of the inside room.  i wish the background was a bit darker.  with the strong contrast between the outside and the inside window panels you could have probably done some nice looking selective leveling on it if you so chose.', '2005-07-30 23:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575091, 210771, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice openess.  a circular polarizer and a blue sky would have really helped those purple hills pop.</td>', 'nice openess.  a circular polarizer and a blue sky would have really helped those purple hills pop.', '2005-07-30 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575094, 210910, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice texture.  nice contrast between inside and out.  would have liked to see the window from more of a straight on pov if possible.</td>', 'nice texture.  nice contrast between inside and out.  would have liked to see the window from more of a straight on pov if possible.', '2005-07-30 23:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575101, 210925, 13688, '<td valign="top">good focus.  not sure i like the 2 textured background.  and it kind of looks like a carpet which would be a strange place for a glass of milk.  not sure i get how there''s any room to dunk as the milk looks like it couldn''t be fuller.  would also make the milk a bit more appealing if it was drunk down a bit, perhaps adding a little froth might help as well.  it kind of looks like a big block of elmer''s glue as is.</td>', 'good focus.  not sure i like the 2 textured background.  and it kind of looks like a carpet which would be a strange place for a glass of milk.  not sure i get how there''s any room to dunk as the milk looks like it couldn''t be fuller.  would also make the milk a bit more appealing if it was drunk down a bit, perhaps adding a little froth might help as well.  it kind of looks like a big block of elmer''s glue as is.', '2005-07-31 00:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575103, 210789, 13688, '<td valign="top">like that i can feel the slimy  texture of his skin.  flash ended up a bit hot on his back and the rock.  would have been a bit more personal if the guy was looking at the camera.  the shadow under his head is a bit distracting as well.</td>', 'like that i can feel the slimy  texture of his skin.  flash ended up a bit hot on his back and the rock.  would have been a bit more personal if the guy was looking at the camera.  the shadow under his head is a bit distracting as well.', '2005-07-31 00:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575120, 210890, 13688, '<td valign="top">cool location.  nice focus for the longer shutter.  the colors seem kind of bland.  probably not much you could do with overcast light.  maybe converting to b/w would have strengthened it for me.  i would have cropped a bit more down on the left side as the bright rock and the moss seems to grab a bunch of attention and pull my eye off of the main interest</td>', 'cool location.  nice focus for the longer shutter.  the colors seem kind of bland.  probably not much you could do with overcast light.  maybe converting to b/w would have strengthened it for me.  i would have cropped a bit more down on the left side as the bright rock and the moss seems to grab a bunch of attention and pull my eye off of the main interest', '2005-07-31 00:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575128, 210753, 13688, '<td valign="top">good focus.  i''m wondering if a tighter composition or daring him to get up on those rocks would have even improved the vastness feeling by removing all of the stuff at the bottom of the pic.</td>', 'good focus.  i''m wondering if a tighter composition or daring him to get up on those rocks would have even improved the vastness feeling by removing all of the stuff at the bottom of the pic.', '2005-07-31 00:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575133, 210538, 13688, '<td valign="top">good clarity.  i''m left wondering if you could have found another compositon without the grass in front and the tree on the right and with a stronger view of the mountains.  perhaps it wasn''t possible...but i''m still left wondering.</td>', 'good clarity.  i''m left wondering if you could have found another compositon without the grass in front and the tree on the right and with a stronger view of the mountains.  perhaps it wasn''t possible...but i''m still left wondering.', '2005-07-31 00:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575136, 210714, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting take.  i would have thought to show the hand from the inside placing the sign on the door...but perhaps that''s a bit cliche.  really like your toning.</td>', 'interesting take.  i would have thought to show the hand from the inside placing the sign on the door...but perhaps that''s a bit cliche.  really like your toning.', '2005-07-31 00:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
