(1575201, 210871, 28710, '<td valign="top">What an unexpected title. In a picture that resembles an older monastery or convent. Are you making reference to Chattages of catholic infamy?<br/> <br/>Chattages were the common name for when the upper level priests of a seminary would take young boys, priests in training, into their room for a "chat" of an indecent nature.</td>', 'What an unexpected title. In a picture that resembles an older monastery or convent. Are you making reference to Chattages of catholic infamy? Chattages were the common name for when the upper level priests of a seminary would take young boys, priests in training, into their room for a "chat" of an indecent nature.', '2005-07-31 01:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575205, 210861, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really weird, but that''s probably what you intended.  Interesting for sure!!!</td>', 'This is really weird, but that''s probably what you intended.  Interesting for sure!!!', '2005-07-31 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575208, 210925, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is a super idea and a very well executed picture. Is that skim milk? It looks a bit watery to my eye. I wonder if full cream would have made a better picture. Probably wouldn''t have helped in the post-shot cleanup though... yech.<br/> <br/>Also, I just read a little tutorial on fixing horizons. If you are interested, it is in the tutorials section of this website. I feel this picture would have benefitted from a minor rotate.</td>', 'This is a super idea and a very well executed picture. Is that skim milk? It looks a bit watery to my eye. I wonder if full cream would have made a better picture. Probably wouldn''t have helped in the post-shot cleanup though... yech. Also, I just read a little tutorial on fixing horizons. If you are interested, it is in the tutorials section of this website. I feel this picture would have benefitted from a minor rotate.', '2005-07-31 01:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575223, 210652, 28710, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the expression on his face, but Westerners sure are soft when it comes to "full". Daily fact of life in Asia is probably twice that full. There''s always room for one more.</td>', 'Gotta love the expression on his face, but Westerners sure are soft when it comes to "full". Daily fact of life in Asia is probably twice that full. There''s always room for one more.', '2005-07-31 01:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575277, 210650, 34217, '<td valign="top">made me giggle</td>', 'made me giggle', '2005-07-31 01:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575302, 210879, 31213, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been more powerful without the bunched up black material....it has a very forced, posed look....if you had the same glass of wine on a wooden table with a bowl of fruit and maybe soft natural window light, it would have achieved the same affect without the "posed" look.  Just my two cents!  :)</td>', 'I think it would have been more powerful without the bunched up black material....it has a very forced, posed look....if you had the same glass of wine on a wooden table with a bowl of fruit and maybe soft natural window light, it would have achieved the same affect without the "posed" look.  Just my two cents!  :)', '2005-07-31 02:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575314, 210559, 31213, '<td valign="top">The brightness seems a little dull around the chairs/tables....but the hightlight of light looks great!</td>', 'The brightness seems a little dull around the chairs/tables....but the hightlight of light looks great!', '2005-07-31 03:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
