(1577678, 210753, 38078, '<td valign="top">He looks like a conductor or drum major.  very nice!  I can hear the music of the scenery.  some voters might argue however that space is not the same thing as a room.</td>', 'He looks like a conductor or drum major.  very nice!  I can hear the music of the scenery.  some voters might argue however that space is not the same thing as a room.', '2005-08-01 08:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
