(1577695, 210815, 31606, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  I gave you a 5 only because of a few things and I will explain:<br/> <br/>First: I think it is too tight of a crop.  Step back a little and get more of the bathtub.<br/>Second: I really don''t care too much for the soft focus but didn''t count off a lot for that only because it is personal opinion. It also appears that the candle in the back is totally out of focus.  A bigger DOF would also help.<br/>Third: If you had stepped back a little and had a subject in the tub I feel this would get your point across a lot better than it does now. Maybe someone in there reading a book or just with their eyes closed and their head rested on the tub.<br/>Fourth: Once that was done I would get a lower POV.  <br/> <br/>I really hope this helps.  Good luck in all your future challenges.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  I gave you a 5 only because of a few things and I will explain: First: I think it is too tight of a crop.  Step back a little and get more of the bathtub.Second: I really don''t care too much for the soft focus but didn''t count off a lot for that only because it is personal opinion. It also appears that the candle in the back is totally out of focus.  A bigger DOF would also help.Third: If you had stepped back a little and had a subject in the tub I feel this would get your point across a lot better than it does now. Maybe someone in there reading a book or just with their eyes closed and their head rested on the tub.Fourth: Once that was done I would get a lower POV.   I really hope this helps.  Good luck in all your future challenges.', '2005-08-01 08:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
