(1578614, 210911, 40355, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but the colors seem a little off to me.  Maybe a bit of adjustment of contrast, hue, etc. would have helped?  It could have been an asset to have a bird or aircraft in the shot, too.  That said, if I look at it right, I get a kind of dizzy feeling, as if I can see the clouds moving.</td>', 'Good shot, but the colors seem a little off to me.  Maybe a bit of adjustment of contrast, hue, etc. would have helped?  It could have been an asset to have a bird or aircraft in the shot, too.  That said, if I look at it right, I get a kind of dizzy feeling, as if I can see the clouds moving.', '2005-08-01 16:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
