(1578973, 210695, 13688, '<td valign="top">i used to have a computer science teacher that always quipped to "not be a mushroom".  Of course it did get old at some point.  But still, this image holds a special place in my heart for that.  Unfortunately your focus is way too soft unless you were going for something hallucinegenic.  And those black specs and the white balance doesn''t add to their appetizingness.  Anyway thanks for the memories.</td>', 'i used to have a computer science teacher that always quipped to "not be a mushroom".  Of course it did get old at some point.  But still, this image holds a special place in my heart for that.  Unfortunately your focus is way too soft unless you were going for something hallucinegenic.  And those black specs and the white balance doesn''t add to their appetizingness.  Anyway thanks for the memories.', '2005-08-01 19:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1578978, 210800, 32345, '<td valign="top">This is a rare case where i love the border, it adds something to the picture, the blue bowl and border againts all the white is beautifull. great picture.</td>', 'This is a rare case where i love the border, it adds something to the picture, the blue bowl and border againts all the white is beautifull. great picture.', '2005-08-01 19:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1578983, 210894, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the lens you''ve chosen, and your lighting is interesting.  i wouldn''t want to be the next guy in after someone had to use up the super duty roll on the right.</td>', 'i like the lens you''ve chosen, and your lighting is interesting.  i wouldn''t want to be the next guy in after someone had to use up the super duty roll on the right.', '2005-08-01 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
