(1579004, 210719, 35602, '<td valign="top">You must have been on the road.  The photo seems really overexposed.  Maybe if you dropped down the light comensatiion a step it would have been less grainy and bright.</td>', 'You must have been on the road.  The photo seems really overexposed.  Maybe if you dropped down the light comensatiion a step it would have been less grainy and bright.', '2005-08-01 19:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
