(1579038, 210868, 35602, '<td valign="top">Must be very relaxing.  The gazebo seems flat when compared to the bush and flowers.  Were you layering to correct exposure?  Anyway, the gazebo exposure is really not matching the rest of the picture.</td>', 'Must be very relaxing.  The gazebo seems flat when compared to the bush and flowers.  Were you layering to correct exposure?  Anyway, the gazebo exposure is really not matching the rest of the picture.', '2005-08-01 20:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
