(1579140, 210713, 13688, '<td valign="top">the smoothness is delightful.  i wish you made the court the center of your attention as these bleachers though understandably making your point by being closed really are not that appealing to me.  i do really like how the light hits that wall...still not so sure about the rest of the composition.</td>', 'the smoothness is delightful.  i wish you made the court the center of your attention as these bleachers though understandably making your point by being closed really are not that appealing to me.  i do really like how the light hits that wall...still not so sure about the rest of the composition.', '2005-08-01 20:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
