(1579494, 210643, 39850, '<td valign="top">''8'' - Good shot.  Criticism; For me, this would be a better photograph if you had obtained more swing momentum.  I would like to see the cat swung higher, so that it''s legs were almost totally blurred.  Traditionally, I believe that to correctly calculate that there is indeed enough room to swing a cat you have to hold it by one leg or the tail and then swing.  Good interpretation of the word ''room'' in this fairly ''open'' style Challenge, although the cat is clearly unimpressed.  Nice colors.</td>', '''8'' - Good shot.  Criticism; For me, this would be a better photograph if you had obtained more swing momentum.  I would like to see the cat swung higher, so that it''s legs were almost totally blurred.  Traditionally, I believe that to correctly calculate that there is indeed enough room to swing a cat you have to hold it by one leg or the tail and then swing.  Good interpretation of the word ''room'' in this fairly ''open'' style Challenge, although the cat is clearly unimpressed.  Nice colors.', '2005-08-01 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579527, 210710, 39850, '<td valign="top">''8'' - Very nice shot.  The sky looks great.  Criticism; the jury is out on whether (for me, in my opinion) this would be a better shot without the person.  Definitely though, for me, if the person were facing forward or to the camera, it would make it a better photograph in my opinion, though I know it may be the intent to have them looking ''out''.  I favor most the green of the grass (which I would like to see more detail in somehow, perhaps a sharper angle?), and that great blue sky and the clouds.</td>', '''8'' - Very nice shot.  The sky looks great.  Criticism; the jury is out on whether (for me, in my opinion) this would be a better shot without the person.  Definitely though, for me, if the person were facing forward or to the camera, it would make it a better photograph in my opinion, though I know it may be the intent to have them looking ''out''.  I favor most the green of the grass (which I would like to see more detail in somehow, perhaps a sharper angle?), and that great blue sky and the clouds.', '2005-08-02 00:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579540, 210674, 39850, '<td valign="top">''8'' - Good shot.  Criticism; sharper focus on the dog would make this a better photograph in my opinion.  Perhaps a slight nudge rotation left, and a tighter crop at the bottom and bring in more (if possible) of the cover.</td>', '''8'' - Good shot.  Criticism; sharper focus on the dog would make this a better photograph in my opinion.  Perhaps a slight nudge rotation left, and a tighter crop at the bottom and bring in more (if possible) of the cover.', '2005-08-02 00:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579551, 210856, 39850, '<td valign="top">''7'' - Nice concept.  Criticism; for me, I would like to see slightly bolder colors, the sky is nice as it is but I would like to see more contrast on the green/hill, especially picking up more of the shadows.  Also, for me, if you had cropped it to remove that branch(?) middle to left fore, would be better.  If it was possible, a horizontal rather than vertical frame, would have made this a better photograph (and more apt given your title) in my opinion.</td>', '''7'' - Nice concept.  Criticism; for me, I would like to see slightly bolder colors, the sky is nice as it is but I would like to see more contrast on the green/hill, especially picking up more of the shadows.  Also, for me, if you had cropped it to remove that branch(?) middle to left fore, would be better.  If it was possible, a horizontal rather than vertical frame, would have made this a better photograph (and more apt given your title) in my opinion.', '2005-08-02 00:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579561, 210870, 39850, '<td valign="top">''7'' - The concept here is nice and the ''scenery'' very good and I like the coloring effect (can''t discern if it is sepia or not).  Criticism; in my opinion, this would have had much more impact if there were ''less''.  Even just the blanket, tray, flowers, book... would have looked good.  Or just the chair and the table and flowers and glass, etc.  A slightly different crop to balance out the shrubs perhaps, or emphasize that larger one on the right, would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '''7'' - The concept here is nice and the ''scenery'' very good and I like the coloring effect (can''t discern if it is sepia or not).  Criticism; in my opinion, this would have had much more impact if there were ''less''.  Even just the blanket, tray, flowers, book... would have looked good.  Or just the chair and the table and flowers and glass, etc.  A slightly different crop to balance out the shrubs perhaps, or emphasize that larger one on the right, would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-08-02 00:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579589, 210559, 39850, '<td valign="top">''8'' - Very nice light capture.  Criticism; for me, I think that if you had removed all the tables and chairs from the frame, also that pin up board, it would have made this photo more dramatic and a better photograph in my opinion.  Obviously this may not have been possible.  Also, I think b/w might look nice here.  If you had cropped out the top (ceiling) this would still be a good photograph, albeit a different feel.</td>', '''8'' - Very nice light capture.  Criticism; for me, I think that if you had removed all the tables and chairs from the frame, also that pin up board, it would have made this photo more dramatic and a better photograph in my opinion.  Obviously this may not have been possible.  Also, I think b/w might look nice here.  If you had cropped out the top (ceiling) this would still be a good photograph, albeit a different feel.', '2005-08-02 00:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579591, 210897, 39850, '<td valign="top">''8'' - Wow.  Very good capture and forethought.  Never seen this angle before in a photograph.  Criticism; as I am sure you are aware, some more light, sharper focus, etc.  If you could make out the ''kids'' more, even if they are not in full focus, would make this a much better photograph in my opinion.  This has so much potential.  Do not know how you did it or if it was the first time you have tried this but I am sure if you keep it up one day you will land an excellent shot.  Final note, if this IS ''fake'', ignore everything I just said.</td>', '''8'' - Wow.  Very good capture and forethought.  Never seen this angle before in a photograph.  Criticism; as I am sure you are aware, some more light, sharper focus, etc.  If you could make out the ''kids'' more, even if they are not in full focus, would make this a much better photograph in my opinion.  This has so much potential.  Do not know how you did it or if it was the first time you have tried this but I am sure if you keep it up one day you will land an excellent shot.  Final note, if this IS ''fake'', ignore everything I just said.', '2005-08-02 00:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579654, 210559, 13688, '<td valign="top">very cool effect.  did you consider cropping just after the ceiling light stream hits that first light?  having it with the break feels odd to me.  overall nice shot.</td>', 'very cool effect.  did you consider cropping just after the ceiling light stream hits that first light?  having it with the break feels odd to me.  overall nice shot.', '2005-08-02 01:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1579676, 210892, 13688, '<td valign="top">i hear birds chirping when i look at this so it must do it''s job.  good border choice.  really like the painterly feel of the background contrasted with the photo realistic foreground.  too bad she was wearing such a reflective shirt as the exposure is great everywhere except on it.</td>', 'i hear birds chirping when i look at this so it must do it''s job.  good border choice.  really like the painterly feel of the background contrasted with the photo realistic foreground.  too bad she was wearing such a reflective shirt as the exposure is great everywhere except on it.', '2005-08-02 01:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
