(1585292, 210695, 24065, '<td valign="top">You title is clever and the idea is creative.  I might suggest a little work on focusing -- voters on DPC love a sharp focus!  A lower ISO setting or more light might help the noise.  Hope this is helpful information.  :)</td>', 'You title is clever and the idea is creative.  I might suggest a little work on focusing -- voters on DPC love a sharp focus!  A lower ISO setting or more light might help the noise.  Hope this is helpful information.  :)', '2005-08-03 22:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585296, 210650, 24065, '<td valign="top">Too funny!!! I would have voted it higher if the other end had been sticking out!  ;-)</td>', 'Too funny!!! I would have voted it higher if the other end had been sticking out!  ;-)', '2005-08-03 22:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585302, 210606, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused, brilliant colors and good composition.  The subject matter lacks a little of the impact/interest that some of the other photos have, but you''re definitely on the right track, I''d say.  :)</td>', 'Nicely focused, brilliant colors and good composition.  The subject matter lacks a little of the impact/interest that some of the other photos have, but you''re definitely on the right track, I''d say.  :)', '2005-08-03 22:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585308, 210614, 24065, '<td valign="top">Good dof, pleasing colors, interesting interpretation of the challenge.  It appears a little noisy -- perhaps a lower ISO or NeatImage might help.  BOL  :)</td>', 'Good dof, pleasing colors, interesting interpretation of the challenge.  It appears a little noisy -- perhaps a lower ISO or NeatImage might help.  BOL  :)', '2005-08-03 22:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585311, 210702, 24065, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition.  I''m wondering why in the world anybody would want you to validate this!  I don''t see anything that could be questioned.  BOL  :)</td>', 'I really like the composition.  I''m wondering why in the world anybody would want you to validate this!  I don''t see anything that could be questioned.  BOL  :)', '2005-08-03 22:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585317, 210714, 24065, '<td valign="top">Clever interpretation of the challenge.  I like the composition, the texture, the lighting and the b&amp;w treatment.  My only suggestion for improvement concerns the lettering -- it appears pixilated (sp?) or oversharpened just around the words.</td>', 'Clever interpretation of the challenge.  I like the composition, the texture, the lighting and the b&w treatment.  My only suggestion for improvement concerns the lettering -- it appears pixilated (sp?) or oversharpened just around the words.', '2005-08-03 22:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585318, 210784, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and colors.  I think it may need to be sharpened a little -- the focus is a bit too soft on the butterfly.</td>', 'I like the composition and colors.  I think it may need to be sharpened a little -- the focus is a bit too soft on the butterfly.', '2005-08-03 22:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585322, 210887, 24065, '<td valign="top">I love your interpretation of the challenge.  The colors and clarity are excellent.  It appears to be a little oversharpened -- it shows up right around the lines in the photo.</td>', 'I love your interpretation of the challenge.  The colors and clarity are excellent.  It appears to be a little oversharpened -- it shows up right around the lines in the photo.', '2005-08-03 22:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585325, 210874, 24065, '<td valign="top">WOW!  No room for improvement here!  You nailed it!</td>', 'WOW!  No room for improvement here!  You nailed it!', '2005-08-03 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585326, 210733, 39483, '<td valign="top">Such a great idea! Very original... I like the facial expression and the composition...oh and great title as well! <br/>Way to think "outside the box"  ;)</td>', 'Such a great idea! Very original... I like the facial expression and the composition...oh and great title as well! Way to think "outside the box"  ;)', '2005-08-03 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585363, 210835, 39483, '<td valign="top">I love the subdued colors and the mild shadows. You can really imagine yourself in this room. The composition is amazing as well (the lone clock, the middle chair abutting  the one for the lefty, the paint on the board, even the black corner works!!!)<br/> <br/>The only thing I can think of would maybe to tilt the image so that  the top line above the blackboard is straight  (I think either straight or much more tilted would work best....but this is such a minor detail!)<br/>Very well done!!!!! Hope you get a ribbon!!!</td>', 'I love the subdued colors and the mild shadows. You can really imagine yourself in this room. The composition is amazing as well (the lone clock, the middle chair abutting  the one for the lefty, the paint on the board, even the black corner works!!!) The only thing I can think of would maybe to tilt the image so that  the top line above the blackboard is straight  (I think either straight or much more tilted would work best....but this is such a minor detail!)Very well done!!!!! Hope you get a ribbon!!!', '2005-08-03 23:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585372, 210760, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great concept and execution!!! the composition works well although placing the tub away from the center might create more eye movement for the viewer.  Well done and nice contrast!!</td>', 'Great concept and execution!!! the composition works well although placing the tub away from the center might create more eye movement for the viewer.  Well done and nice contrast!!', '2005-08-03 23:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
