(1590496, 210652, 749, '<td valign="top">FYI, this wasn''t a <i>very</i> crowded tube train by London rushhour standards - you could fit at least 3 more people in this doorway, and if they pushed everyone back, another 4-5 possibly. Of course, we''re not <i>quite</i> as crammed in as those in Japan etc, but we get close at times ;o) I had to wait for 2-3 trains to come by before a crowded one came by, by which point the battery on my little S40 was getting a bit low, so I waited til everyone from my station had boarded, then shot this just before the doors closed - and I wasn''t too discreet about it either, hence all the people looking at me &amp; my camera!<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments folks, and all the generous votes!</td>', 'FYI, this wasn''t a very crowded tube train by London rushhour standards - you could fit at least 3 more people in this doorway, and if they pushed everyone back, another 4-5 possibly. Of course, we''re not quite as crammed in as those in Japan etc, but we get close at times ;o) I had to wait for 2-3 trains to come by before a crowded one came by, by which point the battery on my little S40 was getting a bit low, so I waited til everyone from my station had boarded, then shot this just before the doors closed - and I wasn''t too discreet about it either, hence all the people looking at me & my camera! Thanks for all the comments folks, and all the generous votes!', '2005-08-06 06:27:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1590502, 210874, 22748, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skylen:</b></div><hr/><i> Great photo, I don''t know if it is a room though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually, I should have been thinking, "there is lots of room here" as opposed to "this is a room". Sorry, my bad, this photo does fit the challenge well, and it''s fabulous.<br/> <br/>Oh yeah, it''s lame, replying to myself, huh? ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by skylen: Great photo, I don''t know if it is a room though.   Actually, I should have been thinking, "there is lots of room here" as opposed to "this is a room". Sorry, my bad, this photo does fit the challenge well, and it''s fabulous. Oh yeah, it''s lame, replying to myself, huh? ;-)', '2005-08-06 06:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
