(1590867, 210874, 29904, '<td valign="top">Could you explain the lense you used?  Is the Aspherical DG to correct for warped appearances of wide-angle views?  Just beginning to learn about lenses and filters since I do not own an SLR - yet!<br/>Thank you and Congrats! this was one of my favorites<br/>-bea</td>', 'Could you explain the lense you used?  Is the Aspherical DG to correct for warped appearances of wide-angle views?  Just beginning to learn about lenses and filters since I do not own an SLR - yet!Thank you and Congrats! this was one of my favorites-bea', '2005-08-06 13:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
