(1594745, 210630, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-he...I almost had as much fun reading the post-challenge comments as I did looking at your photo!  ;^)<br/> <br/>The cat makes the picture.  It stops you, makes you think am I looking in or out?  The composition is cool.  I think the texture of the concrete wall makes the image appear blurry in that area even though it''s not.  Looking at the blacks in the image you can tell the noise level is pretty low, but again, the texture inside the waiting room (wall and floor) make it appear noisier than it is.  This may have contributed to a small hit in scoring.<br/> <br/>I hope the black cat didn''t run in front of you...you know, bad luck and all.  ;^)  <br/> <br/>Take care.<br/>Barry</td>', 'He-he...I almost had as much fun reading the post-challenge comments as I did looking at your photo!  ;^) The cat makes the picture.  It stops you, makes you think am I looking in or out?  The composition is cool.  I think the texture of the concrete wall makes the image appear blurry in that area even though it''s not.  Looking at the blacks in the image you can tell the noise level is pretty low, but again, the texture inside the waiting room (wall and floor) make it appear noisier than it is.  This may have contributed to a small hit in scoring. I hope the black cat didn''t run in front of you...you know, bad luck and all.  ;^)   Take care.Barry', '2005-08-08 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
